ong> each with distinct abilities and weaknesses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic gameplay paths</strong> - aggressive, stealth, or tactical approaches with different outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich lore and characters</strong> through intriguing NPC interactions and Zone mysteries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nostalgic 90s visuals</strong> with retro 3D graphics honoring classic console games.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2425360/extras/35f4a637c4cec0163643a0cb2dc9c80e.poster.avif?t=1753055301\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2425360/extras/35f4a637c4cec0163643a0cb2dc9c80e.webm?t=1753055301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2425360/extras/35f4a637c4cec0163643a0cb2dc9c80e.mp4?t=1753055301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2425360/extras/19d0cd84c730723327a1c03f33e5fd30.poster.avif?t=1753055301\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2425360/extras/19d0cd84c730723327a1c03f33e5fd30.webm?t=1753055301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2425360/extras/19d0cd84c730723327a1c03f33e5fd30.mp4?t=1753055301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2425360/extras/6ded79d7a0f98ffc4826e615d6ea0eb1.poster.avif?t=1753055301\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati